spans.s:
निः-शेषित, अस्, आ, अम्, having nothing left, com-
pletely consumed or finished, destroyed, annihilated;
(wrongly read नि-शेषित.)

निः-श्वसित, अस्, आ, अम्, breathed out, sighed;
sighing, breathing out; (अम्), n. sighing, expiration,
a sigh.

निःसत्त्व निः-सत्त्व, अस्, आ, अम्, without
courage or strength, unenergetic, weak, impotent;
insignificant, low, mean; non-existent, unsubstantial;
deprived of living beings; (अम्), n. absence of power,
want of energy; insignificance; non-existence.

निःसह निः-सह, अस्, आ, अम्, unable to bear
or support or resist, impatient; powerless, weak;
intolerable, unbearable, irresistible.
—निःसह-ता, f.
or निःसह-त्व, अम्, n. inability to bear or support;
impatience, unendurance.
